    `s 4(1) subsections (2) to (5) apply` `I am bringing proceedings to enforce a term of the contract in reliance on section 2`

-- s 4(2).  JUST FALSE here is "this subsection gives the promisor no defence on these facts", not "the promisor has no defence at all":
-- the matter may fall inside another subsection of section 4 or inside the general law the Act leaves alone.
