    `s 5 section 2 affects a right of the promisee to enforce a term of the contract` `the right asked about is a right of the promisee to enforce a term of the contract`

@export Must the court or arbitral tribunal reduce my award because the promisee has already recovered a sum (s 6)?
GIVEN `under section 2 a term of the contract is enforceable by me` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is a term of the contract enforceable by you under section 2?
      `the promisee has recovered from the promisor a sum in respect of my loss in respect of the term` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Has the promisee recovered from the promisor a sum in respect of your loss in respect of the term?
      `the promisee has recovered from the promisor a sum in respect of the promisee's expense of making good to me the default of the promisor` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Has the promisee recovered from the promisor a sum in respect of the promisee's expense of making good to you the default of the promisor?
      `proceedings are brought in reliance on section 2 by me` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Are you bringing proceedings in reliance on section 2?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Must the court or arbitral tribunal reduce my award because the promisee has recovered a sum` IS
    `s 6 the court or arbitral tribunal must reduce any award to the third party` `under section 2 a term of the contract is enforceable by me` `the promisee has recovered from the promisor a sum in respect of my loss in respect of the term` `the promisee has recovered from the promisor a sum in respect of the promisee's expense of making good to me the default of the promisor` `proceedings are brought in reliance on section 2 by me`

-- s 6.  "To such extent as it thinks appropriate": the extent is the court's or tribunal's judgment, and answers
-- NOTHING until it has been decided.
@export What will my award be after the court or arbitral tribunal reduces it, in dollars (s 6)?
GIVEN `under section 2 a term of the contract is enforceable by me` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is a term of the contract enforceable by you under section 2?
      `the promisee has recovered from the promisor a sum in respect of my loss in respect of the term` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Has the promisee recovered from the promisor a sum in respect of your loss in respect of the term?
      `the promisee has recovered from the promisor a sum in respect of the promisee's expense of making good to me the default of the promisor` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Has the promisee recovered from the promisor a sum in respect of the promisee's expense of making good to you the default of the promisor?
      `proceedings are brought in reliance on section 2 by me` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Are you bringing proceedings in reliance on section 2?
      `the award before the reduction` IS A NUMBER @desc What is the award to you before any reduction, in dollars?
      `the court or arbitral tribunal has decided the extent of the reduction` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Has the court or arbitral tribunal decided how far to reduce the award?
      `the extent of the reduction, in dollars` IS A NUMBER @desc By how many dollars has the court or arbitral tribunal decided to reduce the award? (0 if it has decided to reduce it by nothing)
GIVETH A MAYBE NUMBER
DECIDE `What will my award be after the reduction` IS
    `s 6 the award to the third party after the reduction` `under section 2 a term of the contract is enforceable by me` `the promisee has recovered from the promisor a sum in respect of my loss in respect of the term` `the promisee has recovered from the promisor a sum in respect of the promisee's expense of making good to me the default of the promisor` `proceedings are brought in reliance on section 2 by me` `the award before the reduction` (IF `the court or arbitral tribunal has decided the extent of the reduction` THEN JUST `the extent of the reduction, in dollars` ELSE NOTHING)

