    `s 7(3) section 2 confers a right on the third party in the case of the contract` `the contract is a registration document of a limited liability partnership` `the contract is a limited liability partnership agreement`

@export Does section 2 give me a right to enforce a term of a contract of employment against an employee (s 7(4))?
GIVEN `the contract is a contract of employment` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the contract a contract of employment?
      `I seek to enforce the term against an employee` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Do you seek to enforce the term against an employee?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
